			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Output and Sky submodules with bundling fixes and initialization order\n\nSubmodule synchronization across three components:\n\n1. Output: Add HoistFunctionDeclarations and RewriteStaticBlockSelfRef transforms to fix TDZ errors in bundled VS Code after Rollup concatenation converts function declarations to expressions. Hoisting preserves unbundled semantics. RewriteStaticBlockSelfRef converts class self-references in static blocks from `ClassName.member` to `this.member`. Also updates InjectNameShim CSP and RewriteWorkbenchBaseURL for proper module graph tracking.\n\n2. Sky: Fix workbench initialization order by removing static pre-import of desktop.main.js that was breaking Electron service registration. The dynamic import in workbench.js now correctly sets up _VSCode_FILE_ROOT, NLS, and configuration before desktop.main.js module-initializers run, allowing native services (Disk FileSystemProvider, NativeHostService) to register properly. Also configures moduleSideEffects to preserve VS Code static initializers from tree-shaking.\n\n3. Cocoon: Bump protobufjs from 8.0.1 to 8.0.3.\n\nThese changes ensure the bundled workbench boots correctly under Tauri/WKWebView.",
			"SHA": "e7e25452f8c33f52f51ec74ada2b1779899239bd"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-28T05:26:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				28,
				13
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Sync submodules with environment variable renaming and output improvements\n\nSubmodule synchronization across 13 components bringing major refactoring:\n\n1. Environment Variable Standardization (Air, Grove, Mountain, Sky, Wind):\n   - LAND_DEV_LOG → Trace\n   - LAND_ENABLE_WIND → Render\n   - LAND_POSTHOG_* → {Authorize,Beam,Report,Throttle,Buffer,Batch,Replay,Ask,Brand}\n   - BUNDLED_WORKBENCHES → Pack, LAND_BUNDLED_BOOT → Boot\n   - LAND_SKIP_BUILTIN_EXTENSIONS → Skip\n   - LAND_AUTO_INSTALL_EXTENSION_DEPS → Install\n   - LAND_WARN_MISSING_BROWSER_BUNDLES → Warn\n   - __LAND_CEL_TRACK__ → __Track, _LAND_ERROR_HOOK → _Catch\n   - LAND_DNS_SERVER → Resolve\n\n2. Output Bundle Optimization (Output, Sky):\n   - Implement ApplyPipeline for post-build transforms\n   - Add InlineCSSImport, InjectWebViewPolyfills, RewriteWorkerURLs\n   - Consolidate CSS into single file (cssCodeSplit: false)\n   - Use manualChunks to fold VS Code modules into single workbench-*.js\n   - Exclude StaticToDynamicImport from bundled output\n\n3. Multiple Window Support (Mountain):\n   - Add supports-multiple-windows permission\n   - Add activity-name and scene-identifier window permissions\n\n4. Code Quality (Cocoon, Common):\n   - Refactor code structure for improved readability\n   - Format code and improve interface documentation",
			"SHA": "d52c66534130b983cc3327041e062dc425e81166"
		},
		{
